{#
    One `BaseTree` entity's records, as a tree.

    THE SWITCH TO THE LIST IS PART OF THE PAGE, not a convenience bolted on. A tree entity has
    exactly one menu entry and it points here (ADR 0025), so this link is the only offered way to
    the filter, the full-text search and the bulk actions of story 002-004. Removing it does not
    remove a feature from this page — it removes one from the entity.

    THE CLASSES THIS GATE READS ARE `admin-tree__switch` AND `admin-tree__node`, and naming them
    here is load-bearing: `tools/harness-baum-pruefen.php` (story 004-001-0006) finds the switch
    and the nodes by exactly these, the way `harness-liste-pruefen.php` reads the table through
    `admin-list__cell`. Renaming one without the gate makes the gate read nothing and stay green.

    THE NODES ARRIVE IN 004-001-0003. This page is the route and its frame; the tree itself, its
    collapsing and the actions on a node are the following tasks. An empty frame is deliberate
    here — the three gates of `TreeController` are easier to prove on a page that does nothing
    else.
#}{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block bodyAttributes %} class="admin"{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<main class="admin__main">
    <h1>{{ entity }}</h1>

    <p class="admin-tree__switch"><a href="{{ listUrl }}">Als Liste anzeigen</a></p>
</main>
{% endblock %}
